{"data": [{"author_id": "423181746", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:16:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117017842323173696"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 60, "start": 55, "tag": "CLLS"}]}, "id": "2117017842323173696", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 196, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "One base editing shot cut triglycerides 75%. In mice.\n\n$CLLS's .HEAL-101 (ESGCT): ~65% editing of human APOC3 in humanized liver mice, liver only, no double strand break.\n\nPreclinical. First human data 2H27 from a China investigator trial. Can one edit replace repeat APOC3 shots?", "url": "https://x.com/RazorSharpDNA/status/2117017842323173696"}, {"author_id": "1108369154195767297", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:24:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117004946935853501"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "PRME"}], "urls": [{"description": "Prime Medicine stock news: prime editing and liver programs, dated financial resources, operating milestones and the risks that shape the company’s development.", "display_url": "merlintrader.com/prime-medicine…", "end": 202, "expanded_url": "https://www.merlintrader.com/prime-medicine-stock-hub/", "images": [{"height": 400, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117004999507230720/GKw4N27U?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 600}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117004999507230720/GKw4N27U?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 179, "status": 200, "title": "PRME Stock: Prime Medicine News", "unwound_url": "https://www.merlintrader.com/prime-medicine-stock-hub/", "url": "https://t.co/PaBiH4hg9A"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/eVIMAqORJy", "end": 226, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/merlin_trader/status/2117004946935853501/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117004938324623360", "start": 203, "url": "https://t.co/eVIMAqORJy"}]}, "id": "2117004946935853501", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 352, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$PRME weekly close $4.72 (+28.6% w/w), above SMA50 $3.54 / above SMA200 $3.49, RSI 61.5. Range $2.88-$5.91.\n\nPRME Stock Hub: Prime Medicine News, Prime Editing and Liver Programs\nhttps://t.co/PaBiH4hg9A https://t.co/eVIMAqORJy", "url": "https://x.com/merlin_trader/status/2117004946935853501"}, {"author_id": "1518803664596574211", "created_at": "2026-11-02T01:23:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117065075077058955"], "id": "2117065075077058955", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 345, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Despite my natural aversions, I feel CRISPR will be the future.", "url": "https://x.com/syrup_secret/status/2117065075077058955"}, {"author_id": "1687416489308008449", "created_at": "2026-11-02T01:46:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117070737546621306"], "id": "2117070737546621306", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 240, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "What if diagnostics moved faster than disease? 🧬\n\nCRISPR is moving beyond gene editing. A 2025 study detected mpox in just 11 minutes, achieving 99.5% accuracy [1]. Another tested TB across 603 clinical samples, with 93% sensitivity in adult respiratory specimens [2].\n\n⚡ The", "url": "https://x.com/sciqst/status/2117070737546621306"}, {"author_id": "2478044670", "created_at": "2026-11-02T03:20:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117094397804237272"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 209, "start": 201, "tag": "soybean"}, {"end": 217, "start": 210, "tag": "CRISPR"}, {"end": 237, "start": 223, "tag": "GenomeEditing"}], "urls": [{"description": "As global demand for plant protein and edible oil surges, increasing soybean yield has become a top priority in agricultural science. While heterosis utilization is a key pathway for yield improvement, traditional \"three-line\" hybrid systems face significant bottlenecks, including limited genetic resources and low seed production efficiency. A new study from China offers a promising solution by targeting nuclear male sterility genes. The research team, led by Professor Meina Li from Guangzhou University", "display_url": "ow.ly/JRPI5101WLN", "end": 200, "expanded_url": "https://ow.ly/JRPI5101WLN", "start": 177, "status": 200, "title": "The Crop Journal study identifies two redundant nuclear male sterility genes for third-generation hybrid breeding in soybean | KeAi Publishing", "unwound_url": "https://www.keaipublishing.com/en/news/the-crop-journal-study-identifies-two-redundant-nuclear-male-sterility-genes-for-third-generation-hybrid-breeding-in-soybean/", "url": "https://t.co/7S2miqxGJs"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/FH5pf9xnjW", "end": 261, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/KeAiPublishing/status/2117094397804237272/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117094394935357440", "start": 238, "url": "https://t.co/FH5pf9xnjW"}]}, "id": "2117094397804237272", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 51, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🔬 The Crop Journal study identifies two redundant nuclear male sterility genes for third-generation hybrid breeding in soybean\n📒 Journal: The Crop Journal\n🔎 Discover the study:\nhttps://t.co/7S2miqxGJs\n#soybean #CRISPR/Cas9 #GenomeEditing https://t.co/FH5pf9xnjW", "url": "https://x.com/KeAiPublishing/status/2117094397804237272"}, {"author_id": "1083074300", "created_at": "2026-11-02T05:46:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117131223336415411"], "id": "2117131223336415411", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Next 50 years designer babies will actually be the norm, CrispR is a step ahead now performing invivo testing", "url": "https://x.com/hayyyscoborn/status/2117131223336415411"}, {"author_id": "838635277", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:09:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117106909190742128"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 7, "start": 0, "tag": "CRISPR"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/jamexnik_/stat…", "end": 38, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/jamexnik_/status/2116958581815955569", "start": 15, "url": "https://t.co/GSrGy7yk5U"}]}, "id": "2117106909190742128", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 751, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116958581815955569", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "#CRISPR 🍑🍓🥑🍅🌽🥕 https://t.co/GSrGy7yk5U", "url": "https://x.com/CrisprGlenn/status/2117106909190742128"}, {"author_id": "219381801", "created_at": "2026-11-02T01:42:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117069682285183178"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 8, "start": 0, "tag": "硅谷孵化器项目"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/jamexnik_/stat…", "end": 97, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jamexnik_/status/2116958581815955569", "start": 74, "url": "https://t.co/EEroFWjG6U"}]}, "id": "2117069682285183178", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116958581815955569", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "#硅谷孵化器项目 YC投的Nitroduck将CRISPR整合进育种流程，通过花粉让作物可进行基因编辑，支持设计水果和蔬菜的颜色，风味及抗病性。\n\nhttps://t.co/EEroFWjG6U", "url": "https://x.com/a2z_lightcone/status/2117069682285183178"}, {"author_id": "1574121372699086851", "created_at": "2026-11-02T06:14:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117138193183318252"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/_chenglou/stat…", "end": 273, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/_chenglou/status/2117109796474323444", "start": 250, "url": "https://t.co/4Mzii7tAiy"}]}, "id": "2117138193183318252", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117109796474323444", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The Gattaca framing misses the point. From an engineering perspective, the interesting part isn't the editing itself but removing the stem cell bottleneck that kept CRISPR viable for only ~15% of crops. Pollen delivery is the actual innovation here. https://t.co/4Mzii7tAiy", "url": "https://x.com/SvenUrbanSci/status/2117138193183318252"}, {"author_id": "1323534820840976385", "created_at": "2026-11-02T01:19:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117063894359302533"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 12, "start": 0, "tag": "ForestryRes"}, {"end": 27, "start": 13, "tag": "abioticstress"}, {"end": 33, "start": 28, "tag": "salt"}, {"end": 44, "start": 34, "tag": "tolerance"}], "mentions": [{"end": 223, "id": "1364865674326274049", "start": 207, "username": "MaximumAcademic"}, {"end": 240, "id": "3501523812", "start": 224, "username": "plantstress2050"}], "urls": [{"description": "Homeodomain leucine zipper (HD-ZIP) proteins are plant-specific transcription factors that play important roles in plant development and abiotic responses. In our previous study, the PagHB7a gene was identified, which belongs to the Class I HD ZIP family, and was among the most significantly induced genes by salt stress in poplar. In the present study, the role of PagHB7a was functionally characterized in salt stress responses. Expression analysis confirmed that PagHB7a was significantly induced by salt and abscisic acid (ABA) treatments; moreover, PagHB7a was directly regulated by the ABA-responsive element (ABRE) binding proteins (PagAREB1s). Genetic analysis showed that overexpression of PagHB7a (PagHB7a-OE) significantly enhanced salt tolerance, whereas CRISPR/Cas9-mediated knockout of PagHB7a (PagHB7a-KO) significantly reduced it. Transcriptome analysis revealed that biological pathways responding to salt stress, ABA, and oxidative stress were significantly upregulated in PagHB7a-", "display_url": "maxapress.com/article/doi/10…", "end": 273, "expanded_url": "https://www.maxapress.com/article/doi/10.48130/forres-0025-0030", "images": [{"height": 2484, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117063951892598784/_fefYNsI?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 3780}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117063951892598784/_fefYNsI?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 250, "status": 200, "title": "The Class I HD-ZIP transcription factor PagHB7a functions as a positive regulator of salt tolerance in Populus", "unwound_url": "https://www.maxapress.com/article/doi/10.48130/forres-0025-0030", "url": "https://t.co/EV6S9usPlT"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/4rpAsBMmtd", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ForestryRes/status/2117063894359302533/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113893181712715776", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/4rpAsBMmtd"}]}, "id": "2117063894359302533", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 55, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "#ForestryRes #abioticstress #salt #tolerance\nPoplar transcription factor PagHB7a enhances salt tolerance via ABA and oxidative stress pathways, while CRISPR knockout reduces plant tolerance dramatically! 🌱🧬\n@MaximumAcademic @plantstress2050\nDetails: https://t.co/EV6S9usPlT https://t.co/4rpAsBMmtd", "url": "https://x.com/ForestryRes/status/2117063894359302533"}, {"author_id": "1871607558550810624", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:23:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117110237954257012"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/O9V42OanYV", "end": 306, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Reprogenetics_/status/2117110237954257012/video/1", "media_key": "13_2117104130758201344", "start": 283, "url": "https://t.co/O9V42OanYV"}]}, "id": "2117110237954257012", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 82, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Should we correct disease mutations before a child is born? Dr. Eriona Hysolli, formerly @ Church lab &amp; Colossal Bio, spoke at Reproductive Frontiers 2026 about why embryo-stage prevention of severe genetic disease deserves a path forward.\n\nYouTube link in reply.⬇️\n\nTimestamps: https://t.co/O9V42OanYV", "url": "https://x.com/Reprogenetics_/status/2117110237954257012"}, {"author_id": "1820662506190151680", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:28:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036055887303091"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 109, "start": 102, "tag": "CRISPR"}, {"end": 122, "start": 110, "tag": "CRISPResso2"}, {"end": 154, "start": 147, "tag": "CRISPR"}], "mentions": [{"end": 88, "id": "977339121655009281", "start": 73, "username": "KendellClement"}, {"end": 101, "id": "50328723", "start": 89, "username": "lucapinello"}, {"end": 174, "id": "977339121655009281", "start": 159, "username": "KendellClement"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "crispresso2.pinellolab.org", "end": 146, "expanded_url": "https://crispresso2.pinellolab.org", "start": 123, "status": 302, "unwound_url": "https://crispresso2.pinellolab.org/home", "url": "https://t.co/UW4aG8mVbo"}]}, "id": "2117036055887303091", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "CRISPResso2 provides accurate and rapid genome editing sequence analysis @kendellclement @lucapinello #CRISPR #CRISPResso2 https://t.co/UW4aG8mVbo #CRISPR via @kendellclement", "url": "https://x.com/AutoNate_AI/status/2117036055887303091"}, {"author_id": "1248891567630422016", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:29:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117111803591156147"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "CRISPR-Cas12a biosensing is hindered by insufficient sensitivity that necessitates pre-amplification, as well as the limited ability to directly detect non-nucleic-acid targets. Herein, we developed a CRISPR-Cas12a biosensor centered on a DNAzyme-activated engineered crRNA (e-crRNA), enabling Mn …", "display_url": "ift.tt/UkCFyMj", "end": 114, "expanded_url": "https://ift.tt/UkCFyMj", "images": [{"height": 830, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117111804774027264/W_gP0nHi?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1600}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117111804774027264/W_gP0nHi?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 91, "status": 200, "title": "A DNAzyme-activated engineered crRNA enables CRISPR-Cas12a biosensing of ALP and S. aureus - PubMed", "unwound_url": "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/42925592/?utm_source=Other&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=pubmed-2&utm_content=1FSk0ACuTgzVVLMbl5BiJVg__ElwqXtM2VVHVfIJCNELGROgzC&fc=20240206234155&ff=20261101232915&v=2.20.1", "url": "https://t.co/4WAGKPilWY"}]}, "id": "2117111803591156147", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 54, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A DNAzyme-activated engineered crRNA enables CRISPR-Cas12a biosensing of ALP and S. aureus https://t.co/4WAGKPilWY", "url": "https://x.com/Staph_papers/status/2117111803591156147"}, {"author_id": "1248105490581557248", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:19:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117109249616519506"], "id": "2117109249616519506", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Nitroduck 正在開發一種基因編輯平台，透過花粉顆粒傳遞 CRISPR，讓育種者能夠在更廣泛的作物中引入新特徵和疾病抗性。該公司目標是將育種時間從 8–16 年縮短至不到四年，讓育種者能夠比病原體適應更快地引入抗病品種。\n\n這項技術還能讓育種者根據消費者趨勢開發新的水果和蔬菜，就像時尚產業一樣。", "url": "https://x.com/what_how_IM/status/2117109249616519506"}, {"author_id": "818008252814217217", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:03:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116999470231797768"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 208, "start": 201, "tag": "CRISPR"}], "urls": [{"description": "Recent advances in CRISPR technologies for biomedical applications and disease treatment", "display_url": "doi.org/10.7150/thno.1…", "end": 200, "expanded_url": "https://doi.org/10.7150/thno.136062", "start": 177, "status": 200, "title": "Recent advances in CRISPR technologies for biomedical applications and disease treatment", "unwound_url": "https://www.thno.org/v16p9384.htm", "url": "https://t.co/LlThzOB7rO"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/gCy8JESwJ2", "end": 232, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ScienceCrisp/status/2116999470231797768/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116881111175577600", "start": 209, "url": "https://t.co/gCy8JESwJ2"}]}, "id": "2116999470231797768", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 208, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "REVIEW: Recent advances in CRISPR technologies for biomedical applications and disease treatment.\nWu X, Kou X [..] Zhang M, Wang B, Gong C.\nTheranostics 2026; 16(16):9384-9415.\nhttps://t.co/LlThzOB7rO\n#CRISPR https://t.co/gCy8JESwJ2", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceCrisp/status/2116999470231797768"}, {"author_id": "818008252814217217", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:02:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116999218472915256"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 127, "start": 120, "tag": "CRISPR"}], "urls": [{"description": "AML（急性骨髄性白血病）に見られるNPM1遺伝子変異とはNPM1遺伝子変異は、AMLにおいて最も頻度の高い変異の一つで、成人AMLの約30〜35%に見られます。その典型がエクソン12のc.863_864における4-bp挿入です。挿入される配列は100種類を超えますが、実際の症例の97%超をカバー", "display_url": "crisp-bio.blog.jp/archives/40949…", "end": 119, "expanded_url": "https://crisp-bio.blog.jp/archives/40949559.html", "images": [{"height": 240, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116999265847554048/KtL03zl0?format=png&name=orig", "width": 240}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116999265847554048/KtL03zl0?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 96, "status": 200, "title": "AML患者のNPM1遺伝子に見られる「同一部位の多様なインデル」をLwaCas13aと単一のcrRNAで検出するCRISPR-Scan登場 : crisp_bio", "unwound_url": "https://crisp-bio.blog.jp/archives/40949559.html", "url": "https://t.co/pLPVmLpb5F"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/C4aGIyTpnW", "end": 151, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ScienceCrisp/status/2116999218472915256/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116880712821559296", "start": 128, "url": "https://t.co/C4aGIyTpnW"}]}, "id": "2116999218472915256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 348, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AML患者のNPM1遺伝子に見られる「同一部位の多様なインデル」をLwaCas13aと単一のcrRNAで検出するCRISPR-Scan登場\n(Advanced Science誌刊行論文紹介)\nhttps://t.co/pLPVmLpb5F\n#CRISPR https://t.co/C4aGIyTpnW", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceCrisp/status/2116999218472915256"}, {"author_id": "818008252814217217", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:01:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116998966814384250"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 223, "start": 216, "tag": "CRISPR"}, {"end": 228, "start": 224, "tag": "AML"}], "urls": [{"description": "Accurately detecting diverse same-locus insertions or deletions (indels) remains challenging. This study reveals the mismatch-tolerance profile of LwaCas13a and establishes CRISPR-Scan, which uses a ...", "display_url": "doi.org/10.1002/advs.7…", "end": 215, "expanded_url": "https://doi.org/10.1002/advs.78229", "images": [{"height": 1080, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116998970840915969/0oyCP3AG?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1600}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116998970840915969/0oyCP3AG?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 192, "status": 200, "title": "CRISPR‐Scan: Cas13a Mismatch Tolerance Enabled Ultra‐Multiplexed Detection of Same‐Site Indels in Acute Myeloid Leukemia", "unwound_url": "https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/advs.78229", "url": "https://t.co/gpa3qvxKmA"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/6FgTG0BFbN", "end": 252, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ScienceCrisp/status/2116998966814384250/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116880525038321666", "start": 229, "url": "https://t.co/6FgTG0BFbN"}]}, "id": "21169989