c.x.com/UVhqZXIJaD", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ZenithYeAI/status/2117073344373657666/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117073314556358656", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/UVhqZXIJaD"}]}, "id": "2117073344373657666", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A sentence at midnight. A paper by morning.\n\nClawsGO Science is a research agent with its own cloud lab: 500+ tools, 90+ datasets, a browser, LaTeX. You give it a question and close the laptop.\n\nTheir demo: one line asking for a five-year review of CRISPR delivery. Started 23:47, https://t.co/UVhqZXIJaD", "url": "https://x.com/ZenithYeAI/status/2117073344373657666"}, {"author_id": "397317974", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:21:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117019307842699358"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 177, "start": 165, "tag": "FrontiersIn"}, {"end": 191, "start": 178, "tag": "Microbiology"}]}, "id": "2117019307842699358", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 471, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "New Research: CRISPR/Cas in food microbial biotechnology: from genome editing to precision microbiology www.​frontiersin.​org/articles/10.​3389/fmicb.​2026.​1996037 #FrontiersIn #Microbiology", "url": "https://x.com/FrontMicrobiol/status/2117019307842699358"}, {"author_id": "2079000883665203200", "created_at": "2026-11-02T05:15:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117123308772639014"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/jamexnik_/stat…", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/jamexnik_/status/2116958581815955569", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/UpxF72Cp51"}]}, "id": "2117123308772639014", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 98, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116958581815955569", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Nitroduck just launched as the Crop Design Company. Normal breeding of a specialty variety still takes 8–16 years of random recombination. Standard CRISPR only works on about 15% of crops because it has to enter a single stem cell that is then regenerated into a whole plant. https://t.co/UpxF72Cp51", "url": "https://x.com/gazecommons/status/2117123308772639014"}, {"author_id": "1769377002342039552", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:59:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117028911112450384"], "id": "2117028911112450384", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Wish I had a modest amount of money\nWould blast a bunch of mushrooms with radiation and perform crispr until some cool shit happens", "url": "https://x.com/TheThingInFull/status/2117028911112450384"}, {"author_id": "1681749489713922048", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:06:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117030623479300550"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/DnxJB3wbNM", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/RealOPEN61322/status/2117030623479300550/video/1", "media_key": "13_2117029674521915393", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/DnxJB3wbNM"}]}, "id": "2117030623479300550", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 761, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Between Crispr Technology making this reality at some point and if you then could add in some kind of other tech that would rapidly age all the Fake Womb Babies to roughly 18 with Peak Human Performance extras It'd not only be game over for Women but for All Immigration Forever. https://t.co/DnxJB3wbNM", "url": "https://x.com/RealOPEN61322/status/2117030623479300550"}, {"author_id": "818008252814217217", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:04:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116999721688481980"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "概　要四川大学華西医院の眼科・